canon subject status: unreviewed-promotion checkout — verifying → shipped: brief not approved — .canon/changes/c-checkout/brief.md has no `Approved:` line; a human must answer the brief, and only from that answer the agent will record their words as `Approved: <who> <when> — "<their words>"` in .canon/changes/c-checkout/brief.md
canon subject status: refused — get the human's answer to the brief and record it as its `Approved:` line, or pass --override-reason <text> to move anyway; the waiver is recorded on the subject
